# prior mode=menus sessions have opened the composition screen, picked
# individual slots, pressed `auto`, and even raced two tabs over its save --
# nobody has ever pressed `reroll` itself. Read src/compose.ts first:
# pressReroll calls randomAround(size, you, random) with real Math.random
